<title>CHINA: China bans poultry imports from U.S. - Xinhua.</title>
<headline>China bans poultry imports from U.S. - Xinhua.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has banned the import of U.S. poultry products from Monday due to the breakout of a new poultry disease in the United States, the official Xinhua news agency reported on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>&quot;This move is designed to protect the poultry industry in China,&quot; Xinhua said, quoting the State Bureau of Animal and Plant Quarantine.</p>
<p>Five cases of the disease broke out in Missouri and Oklahoma of the United States between July and September this year, Xinhua said.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
